### Insurance Service API - Authentication Endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7138/api
@contentType = application/json
# Update this token after login
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "phoneNumber": "0901234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "address": "123 Đường ABC",
  "city": "Hà Nội"
}

### 2. Login with registered user
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Register another user
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "Trần Thị B",
  "email": "tranthib@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass456!",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePass456!",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-05-20",
  "gender": "Female",
  "address": "456 Đường XYZ",
  "city": "TP. Hồ Chí Minh"
}

### 4. Login with wrong password (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

### 5. Register with existing email (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Password123!",
  "phoneNumber": "0999999999",
  "dateOfBirth": "1995-03-10",
  "gender": "Male",
  "address": "789 Đường Test",
  "city": "Đà Nẵng"
}

### ================== PROTECTED ENDPOINTS ==================

### 6. Get current user profile (requires authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/UserProfile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Access without token (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/UserProfile/me

### 8. Admin only endpoint (requires Admin role)
GET {{baseUrl}}/UserProfile/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
